  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GAPWUZ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Zimbabwe. The main outcome areas it contributes to are advancing equality and workers rights  building new alliances and pushing progressive politics. The main rights holders are farm workers, both members and non members, male and female. Through trainings, workshops, mobilizing, organizing, capacity building and materials production and wage negotiations the project aims to achieve an Agriculture Industry with sustainable wages and better living and working conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
